    "detailed_description": "Nostalgia called, and it wants its pixels back!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/f51641e4f0e43041efcfafbbd2eb72e7.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/f51641e4f0e43041efcfafbbd2eb72e7.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/f51641e4f0e43041efcfafbbd2eb72e7.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Alabama Bones is a classic point and click adventure game, without the convoluted inventory system or pixel hunting. The familiar storyline comes with a twist: you embark on a journey to return decades of stolen artifacts from museums to their rightful owners.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/393bcdfa56fa24f5ab3e83aa247567b8.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/393bcdfa56fa24f5ab3e83aa247567b8.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/393bcdfa56fa24f5ab3e83aa247567b8.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mouse - just point and click to move and interact with objects.<br></li><li>Gamepad - move the character close to objets and use the action button to trigger interactions.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/a5a5fb379e434b1f85720d001351a11b.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/a5a5fb379e434b1f85720d001351a11b.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/a5a5fb379e434b1f85720d001351a11b.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The first chapter of the game takes us from the Peruvian high desert roads deep into the jungle where our hero needs to find his way back into that one fateful cave. Unfortunately, the cave won't take its secrets back so easily and there will be plenty of unpleasant traps along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/024a9bb91a01ab69a9804b045519f15f.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/024a9bb91a01ab69a9804b045519f15f.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/024a9bb91a01ab69a9804b045519f15f.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Nostalgia called, and it wants its pixels back!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/f51641e4f0e43041efcfafbbd2eb72e7.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/f51641e4f0e43041efcfafbbd2eb72e7.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/f51641e4f0e43041efcfafbbd2eb72e7.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Alabama Bones is a classic point and click adventure game, without the convoluted inventory system or pixel hunting. The familiar storyline comes with a twist: you embark on a journey to return decades of stolen artifacts from museums to their rightful owners.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/393bcdfa56fa24f5ab3e83aa247567b8.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/393bcdfa56fa24f5ab3e83aa247567b8.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/393bcdfa56fa24f5ab3e83aa247567b8.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mouse - just point and click to move and interact with objects.<br></li><li>Gamepad - move the character close to objets and use the action button to trigger interactions.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/a5a5fb379e434b1f85720d001351a11b.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/a5a5fb379e434b1f85720d001351a11b.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/a5a5fb379e434b1f85720d001351a11b.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The first chapter of the game takes us from the Peruvian high desert roads deep into the jungle where our hero needs to find his way back into that one fateful cave. Unfortunately, the cave won't take its secrets back so easily and there will be plenty of unpleasant traps along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/024a9bb91a01ab69a9804b045519f15f.poster.avif?t=1654881236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/024a9bb91a01ab69a9804b045519f15f.webm?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051770/extras/024a9bb91a01ab69a9804b045519f15f.mp4?t=1654881236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
